        <p><strong>Medical Costs:</strong> Students are responsible for their own medical costs. Most costs are covered by ISIC but must first be paid out of pocket. Expect to pay $40-$60 in cash for each medical visit, plus the cost of transportation, labs, and prescriptions (as needed). <strong>AVERAGE MEDICAL VISIT COST: $70 USD</strong></p>
